     dcterms:publisher "European Union Agency for Railways";
     dcterms:title "ERA Ontology"@en;
     a owl:Ontology;
     rdfs:comment """This is the human and machine-readable Ontology governed by the European Union Agency for Railways (https://www.era.europa.eu/). It represents the concepts and relationships linked to the sectorial legal framework and the use cases under the Agency´s remit, as described in the Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) [to be updated after publication] on the common specifications for the register of railway infrastructure [to be updated after publication].


Currently, this Ontology covers the European railway infrastructure and the vehicle types authorized to operate over it. It is a semantic/browsable representation of the RINF application guide (1) and ERATV application guide (2) that were built by domain experts in the RINF and ERATV working parties.

The Ontology also includes the route book concepts described in appendix D2 \"Elements the infrastructure manager has to provide to the railway undertaking for the Route Book\" as presented in the Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) [to be updated after publication] 2019/773 of 16 May 2019 on the technical specification for interoperability relating to the operation and traffic management subsystem of the rail system within the European Union and [to be updated after publication] and the Appendix D3 [to be updated after publication]."""@en;
     rdfs:label "ERA Ontology"@en;
     rdfs:seeAlso "https://www.era.europa.eu/sites/default/files/registers/docs/rinf_application_guide_for_register_en.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI,
                  "https://www.era.europa.eu/sites/default/files/registers/docs/iu-eratv_application_guide_for_register_2016-797_en.pdf"^^xsd:anyURI;
     owl:priorVersion "https://gitlab.com/era-europa-eu/public/interoperable-data-programme/era-ontology/era-ontology/-/releases/v3.1.5"^^xsd:anyURI;
     owl:versionInfo "v3.1.6";
     owl:versionURI <https://gitlab.com/era-europa-eu/public/interoperable-data-programme/era-ontology/era-ontology/-/releases/v3.1.6>;
     skos:changeNote """
Revision 23-01-2026:
- Added clarification on era:etcsLevelType. 
Revision 22-01-2026
- Removed era:orientation (not used yet; overlaps with era:direction).
- Removed skos:editorialNote from era:direction.
- Removed the corresponding references to era:orientation from SHACL validation rules.
- Deprecated era:permitUseReflectivePlates and era:conditionsUseReflectivePlates.
- Updated their status to vs:term_status \"archaic\".
- Deactivated the corresponding SHACL validation rules.

Revision 11-01-2026
- Added subclassOf era:Feature for CommonCharacteristicsSubset.
- Added era:inSkosConceptScheme annotations for era:linesideDistanceIndicationPositioning and added the corresponding SKOS file.

Revision 27-11-2025
- Changed the domain of era:organisationCode from era:OrganisationRole to era:Body according to internal ERA decision on November 26th, 2025.

Revision 25-11-2025
- Added era:maxPermittedTrainLength and the respective SHACL shapes

Revision 21-11-2025
- Added missing owl:SubClassOf from era:NetRelation and era:Feature.

Revision 19-11-2025
- Removed rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty from era:wheelSetGauge and era:gaugingCheckLocation (issue 205)

Revision 17-11-2025
- Created era:partOfTENT, era:typeOfTraffic, and era:europeanTransportCorridor

Revision 12-11-2025
- Added era:XMLName annotations to new properties

Revision 31-10-2025
- Created the TrainDetectionSystemsSpecificChecks SKOS ConceptScheme and the respective SKOS Concepts

Revision 29-10-2025
- Added era:exemptSpecialVehiclesFromATO, era:exemptSpecialVehiclesFromRMR, and era:exemptSpecialVehiclesFromETCS, along with the respective SHACL shapes

Revision 22-10-2025
 - Added shapes for missing classes
 - Added shapes for time related classes and property
 - renamed metadata version for v3.1.5

Revision 17-10-2025
- Added era:RunningTrack as domain of era:vehiclesCompatibleTrafficLoad and era:vehicleTypesCompatibleTrafficLoad

Revision 08-10-2025
- Added missing annotations of deprecated properties with dcterms:isReplacedBy  for era:passesThroughTunnel and era:platformEdge.

Revision 07-10-2025
- Modified range of era:offsetFromOrigin to be xsd:double (see issue Gitlab #165)
- Updated the appropriate SHACL file 

Revision 21-09-2025
- Added era:inNUTS3 and era:passengerFlag with domain era:PrimaryLocation.
- Added corresponding shapes in the file era-shacl/RINF-primary-location.ttl

Revision 30-09-2025
 - finished adding 20 properties for Network statements
 - Todo: create shapes for those properties

Revision 29-09-2025
 - Added proposals for network statements proposed by RNE, see https://github.com/jeropadillaRNE/RNE_Network_Statement_RINF/blob/main/NS_new_parameters.md
 - Todo: add corresponding shacl validation

Revision 22-09-2025
- Created SHACL validation for era:permitUseReflectivePlates

Revision 10-09-2025
- Added skos:altLabel, new comment, and dcterms:source to era:redLightsRequired

Revision 08-09-2025
- Added missing era:leagalDeadline for era:lineNationalId, era:startLocation, era:lineReferenceTunnelEnd, era:contactStripMaterialMetallicContent, era:hasEtcsNationalPacket44, and era:maximumInterferenceCurrentEvaluation

Revision 05-09-2025
- Changed the range of era:subsetName and era:subsidiaryLocationName to rdf:langString for multilingual labels per language.

Revision 03-09-2025
- Added `rdfs:subPropertyOf dcterms:identifier` to era:hotAxleBoxDetectorIdentification, era:lineId,  
era:platformId, era:radioNetworkId  and era:tenGISId.

Revision 26-08-2025
- Removed the subClassOf axiom of era:CommonCharacteristicsSubset rdfs:subClassOf rdf:List.
- Changed the range of era:primaryLocationName to rdf:langString for multilingual labels per language.

Revision 18-08-2025
- Updated the definitions and concepts for era-skos-SignalTypes
- Added initial concepts for era-skos-referenceSystems

Revision 24-07-2025
- Changed the SHACL validations of era:hasPart to make required relations specific to the subclasses of InrastructureElement

Revision 21-07-2025
- Changed the range of era:startsAt and era:endsAt from era:TopologicalCoordinates to era:NetPointReference as outlined in the RINF overview figures

Revision 24-06-2025
- Added SHACL validations for border points

Revision 16-06-2025
- Added SHACL constraint for era:redLightsRequired country applicability

Revision 09-06-2025
- Updated the formatNote of era:trackPhaseInfo and era:trackSystemSeparationInfo
- Deprecated era:phaseInfoChangeSupplySystem and era:systemSeparationInfoChangeSupplySystem
- Fixed unitOfMeasure annotations that used https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/ (with https) instead of the defined prefix unit (which is with http)

Revision 06-06-2025
- Add missing axiom era:PrimaryLocation rdfs:subClassOf era:InfrastructureElement

Revision 26-05-2025
- Fixed the typo in the name of existanceOfIndustrialRisk (-> existenceOfIndustrialRisk) and corrected the legalDeadline according to the legislation

Revision 21-05-2025
-Removed the XMLName annotation from the new entities

Revision 09-05-2025
- Added rdfs:label, rdfs:comment, and rdfs:seeAlso to era:vehicleCategory and era:vehicleSubCategory

Revision 06-05-2025
- Removed the rdfs:subPropertyOf annotation from era:minVehicleImpedanceVoltages

Revision 05-05-2025
- Removed the RINF annotations (XMLname, rinfIndex, and legalDeadline) from etcsNationalPacket44Function
- Added the deprecated and isReplacedBy annotations to etcsNationalPacket44 that was missing, and the respective dct:replaces annotations to etcsNationalPacket44Function and hasEtcsNationalPacket44
- Removed the RINF annotations (XMLname, rinfIndex, and legalDeadline) from etcsRestrictionsConditionsDoc

Revision 30-04-2025
- added rdfs:subClassOf era:Feature annotation for era:InfrastructureElement and era:NetElement

Revision 25-04-2025
 - fixed double type on some properties; 
 - added SubsidiaryLocation ->subclass of era:Feature
 - removed transitivity to fix the reasoner issue
 - removed the parent-child relation from the era:PrimaryLocation

Revision 26-03-2025
- remove external unused external classes and properties
- remove the wgs: prefix and include sf: prefix for the sf:Point

Revision 24-03-2025
- small revision based on the input of the internal control group

Revision 17-03-2025
- harmonize the explanation on the RINF parameters as documents
- remove any unnecessary dcterms:description annotations.
- overall review of general explanations, examples, following the input of ERA TSI experts

Revision 11-03-2025: annotations harmonization
- Removed dcterms:source duplicates with same URI different by https
- Reused rdfs:seeAlso instead of dcterms:source pointing to URLs different from ELI URI legal reference 
- Simple editorial changes based on orthography review
- Add missing levels in the parameters hierarchy and link them to properties representing RINF parameters
- Reintroduction of rinfINndex annotations to the hierarchical properties

Revision 10-03-2025
- Changed the axiom for the era:SubsidiaryLocation
- Fixes on the relations between kilometric posts and the linear positioning system
- Property era:inCountry can be part of a subset with common characteristics
- Property era:infrastructureManager was missing the domain of infrastructure elements
- Addition of the era:connectedTo property to address a simple connectivity between tracks, as RINF parameter 'internal connectivity'.
- Adding missing domains on the properties for the RINF parameters 1.1.1.5.x
- Adding missing domains on the era:notApplicable and era:notYetAvailable property flags
- Adding axioms on the NetRelation to ensure that all properties are provided
- Removed duplicate values for era:applicable

Revision 07-03-2025
- Removed grouping Object properties without subproperties in use: 
   + era:switchesAndCrossingsObjParameter
   + era:relatedElectromagneticInterferencesObjParameter
   + era:energySubsystemDeclarationsVerificationTrackObjParameter
   + era:infraSubsystemDeclarationsVerificationTrackObjParameter


Revision 05-03-2025
- Deprecated era:cantDefficiency

Revision 01-03-2025
- Updated disjointWith axioms in the following cases:
  + all subclasses of era:InfrastructureElement 
  + era:Body, era:InfrastructureElement  
  + era:SubsidiaryLocation, era:PrimaryLocation 
  + era:NetRelation and era:NetElement 
  + era:LinearPositioningSystem and era:LinearPositioningSystemCoordinate
  + era:Feature and era:TemporalFeature
  + all subclasses of era:NetElement

Revision 28-02-2025
- General review of the RINF parameters following the comments received from the RINF Work Group and topical Working Groups members and the ERA experts.
- Additions on the general explanations, format notes and dependency nodes, cleanup duplicate applicability flags, doubles definitions, etc.
- Addition of missing unit of measure for era:cantDeficiencyBasicSSP
- Change the domain of some properties to point to the correctgroup of parameters (era:ContactLineSystem)
- Addition of explanation whenever the XML data set upload is maintained

Revision 20-02-2025
- Introduction of the era:HABD class for representing the Hot Axle Box Detector
- Introduction of the era:tracksideHabd property for linking the InfrastructureElement with the HABD

Revision 18-02-2025
- Added era:inSKOSConceptScheme for the property standardCombinedTransportContainers 
- Updated to stable the term_status for the properties standardCombinedTransportContainers and standardCombinedTransportRollerUnits.

Revision 18-02-2025
- Added dcterms:replaces in cases where there was a dcterms:isReplacedBy pointing to an entity, but no corresponding replaces in the opposite direction, and vice versa.
- Removed dcterms:isReplacedBy statements that pointed to entities no longer present in the ontology. 

Revision 13-02-2025
- Deprecation of era:category and era:subCategory and creation of era:vehicleCategory and era:vehicleSubCategory.

Revision 11-02-2025
- Added annotations to era:etcsNationalPacket44
- Fixed label and definition of era:linesideDistanceIndication 1.1.1.0.0.3
- Changed the domain of era:reasonsEtcsRadioBlockCenterReject 1.1.1.3.2.15, 1.2.1.1.1.15 to era:RadioBlockCenter
- Added axiom subpropertyOf contactLineSystemObjParameter to era:conditionsAppliedRegenerativeBraking 1.1.1.2.2.4.1
- Deleted editorial note from era:minimumVerticalRadius 1.2.2.0.3.3
- Added axiom subpropertyOf tunnelDataParameter to era:hasWalkway 1.1.1.1.8.12
- Removed RINF index from properties used to represent the data format of the RINF parameters (i.e. all ObjParameter and DataParameter properties)

Revision 30-01-2025
- Fix Issue #145 - remove the era:BasicElement and era:AggregatedElement classes and move the properties with them as domain to the super-class InfrastructureElement. Update of all the classes concerned by the hierarchy of InfrastructureElement based on sub-classes. 
- Partially fix issue #148 with comment: topology is on micro level
- Changed the range of era:startOffsetFromOrigin and era:endOffsetFromOrigin into xsd:double and the unit of measure M was added for clarification.
- Added era:existanceOfIndustrialRisk property for defining the RINF parameter 1.1.0.0.1.1 
- Changed era:linesideDistanceIndication according to the decisions of TWG for route book
- Added era:routeBookDataParameter for the route book parameters hierarchy
- Added domains for era:operatingLanguage and era:operationalRegimeType
- Added hierarchy for generic route book related parameter 
- Remove the era:SignalsGrid and all the relations, following the request during a bilateral meeting with Infrabel
- remove redundant era:kilometerNumber and add more details on era:kilometer
- Fix issue #104 - adding era:carrierLinearElement

Revision 13-12-2024
- Added annotations for all SHACL shapes

Revision 12-12-2024:
- deleted deprecated property http://data.europa.eu/949/signallingSystemType following review, there is no instance of it.
- Deleted annotation XMLName from properties that are part of FrenchTrainDetectionSystemLimitation, LoadCapability, MaximumMagneticField, MinVehicleImpedance, PhaseInfo, RaisedPantographsDistanceAndSpeed, SystemSeparationInfo

Revision 10-12-2024:
 - Added the axiom era:Applicability subClassOf era:TemporalFeature
 - Added range of era:ofParameter
 - Renamed era:bridge property to era:hasBridge 
