era:instructionsSwitchRadioSystems era:XMLName "CTS_SwitchRadioSystemCondition";
                                   era:applicable "Y/N/NYA";
                                   era:dependencyNote "Applicable when at least two different radio systems exist. "@en;
                                   era:legalDeadline "12 months after publication of Article 7 Guide"@en;
                                   era:rinfIndex "1.2.1.1.7.2.1",
                                                 "1.1.1.3.8.2.1";
                                   era:shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/InstructionsSwitchRadioSystemsApplicability>,
                                                                <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/InstructionsSwitchRadioSystems>;
                                   era:tsiOPEAppendixD2Index "3.4.4";
                                   dcterms:created "2022-10-28"^^xsd:date;
                                   dcterms:modified "2024-11-04"^^xsd:date,
                                                    "2023-03-14"^^xsd:date,
                                                    "2024-04-18"^^xsd:date,
                                                    "2025-02-28"^^xsd:date;
                                   dcterms:source <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/1695/oj>,
                                                  <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2019/773/oj>;
                                   a owl:ObjectProperty;
                                   rdfs:comment "Name and/or reference of the document specifying the Special instructions to switch over between different radio systems."@en;
                                   rdfs:domain [a owl:Class ; 
                                                owl:unionOf ()];
                                   rdfs:isDefinedBy era:;
                                   rdfs:label "Special instructions to switch over between different radio systems"@en;
                                   rdfs:range era:Document;
                                   rdfs:subPropertyOf era:transitionsBetweenSystemsObjParameter;
                                   status:term_status "stable";
                                   skos:scopeNote """The details of the conditions to switch radio systems must be published.

The value of this parameter should be either a reference to a file name or an external link to a document. 
If a file name is provided, the Infrastructure Manager (IM) must upload a document with the same file name using the \"Reference Documents Management\" functionality in the RINF application. The document must be in electronic format and available in two official EU languages. In this case, the parameter value must be repeated for each document. 
If an external link is provided, the IM must ensure that the document is available at the provided link."""@en.
