              rdfs:subPropertyOf era:signalDataParameter,
                                 era:tunnelDataParameter;
              status:term_status "stable";
              skos:altLabel "Railway location of Operational point"@en;
              skos:scopeNote """For walkways: Value provided in Kilometric point of the start of the walkway and the length in m. Repeatable values for each location.
For rescue points: Value provided in Kilometric point of the start of the point of evacuation and rescue point and the length in m. Repeatable values for each location.
For signals: Relative position to the line identified under parameter 1.1.0.0.0.2, given in km ([reference point, via era:referent] / [NNN.NNN] )."""@en.
